  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nIt would be great if spaces also have notification settings like rooms. After joining a few spaces I was getting constant notifications from various rooms in each space. Currently I had to manually change each rooms notification settings. I think it would be much more convenient if notification settings can be set for whole space. And all subspaces and rooms within that space with default notifications would inherit the notification setting of the the space.\r\n",
